{"statusCode":200,"responseMessage":"GET SUCCESS","data":{"pkId":551637,"category":null,"userName":"학사지원팀","content":"<p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">2026</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">2</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 수강과목에 대한 「강의평가」를 아래와 같이 실시합니다</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의평가 결과는 강의 개선을 위한 소중한 자료로 활용되며</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교육의 질적 향상에 기여할 것입니다</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이러한 취지를 감안하여 솔직하고</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">성심껏 강의평가에 임하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">1. </span><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">평가기간 </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">: 2026</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">10</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">20</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">(</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">화</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">) ~ 11</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">3</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">(</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">화</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">)</span></strong></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 100%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">2. </span><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">평가자</span></strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"> : 2026</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">2</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 재학생 전체</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 100%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">3. </span><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">평가 대상과목</span></strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"> : </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일반과목</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">실험실습과목</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">체육실기과목</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">(</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">각 유형별 별도 설문지</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">)</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 100%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">4. </span><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">평가 제외과목</span></strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"> : 5</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명 미만 강의</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">현장실습</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">논문</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">/</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">특수연구</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">팀티칭 강의</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, FA</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">받은 과목 등</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 100%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">5. </span><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">평가 방법</span></strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"> : SAINT</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">포털 내 학사관리</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수업</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">/</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">성적</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">-&gt;'</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의평가 및 학기별 성적</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">'</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에서 과목 별로 평가</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">6. </span><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참고사항</span></strong></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 50%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 50%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">- </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의평가는 </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">SAINT </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">로그인을 통하여 비공개로 실시되며</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">평가자에 대한 익명성이 철저히 보장됩니다</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">(</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">객관식은 과목별 평균점수로만 보여지며</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주관식 설문은 입력 순서대로 기록됨</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">)</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">- </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의평가에 응답하지 않으면 해당과목의 성적 조회가 제한됩니다</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">보다 많은 학생들의 설문 참여를 위한 부득이한 조치임을 이해하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%; text-align: center\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">2026</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">10</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">19</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%; text-align: center\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교 무 처 장</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%; text-align: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">[Undergraduate] Midterm Course Evaluation for Fall 2026</span></strong></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The midterm course evaluation for Fall 2026 will be conducted as outlined below.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Course evaluations provide valuable feedback for improving teaching and enhancing the overall quality of education at the University. Students are encouraged to participate thoughtfully and provide honest and constructive feedback.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">1. Evaluation period</span></strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">: Oct. 20(Tue) </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">– </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Nov. 3(Tue), 2026</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 100%\">&nbsp;</p><ol start=\"2\"><li><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Eligible Students</span></strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">: All  undergraduate students enrolled in Fall 2026</span></p></li></ol><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 100%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">3. Courses Subject to Evaluation</span></strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">: General courses, laboratory and practical courses, and physical education practical courses (separate questionnaires are provided for each course type)</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 100%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">4. Courses Excluded from Evaluation</span></strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">: Courses with fewer than five students, field training courses, thesis and special research courses, team teaching courses, courses in which students received an FA</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 100%\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">5. Evaluation Procedure</span></strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">: SAINT </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">→ </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Academic Management </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">→ </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Courses/Grades </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;; font-family: 함초롬바탕\">→ </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Course Evaluation and Grades by Semester (evaluation by course)</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\">&nbsp;</p><ol start=\"6\"><li><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><strong>Notes</strong></p></li></ol><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">- Students must log in to SAINT to conduct evaluations, and all information provided will be treated as strictly confidential with guaranteed anonymity. (For multiple choice questions, only the average score for each course is shown, while essay questions are recorded in the order of input.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">- Students who do not complete the evaluation will be unable to view their grades for the courses concerned.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Please understand that this measure is intended to encourage broader student participation in the course evaluation.</span></p><p style=\"min-height: 32px; line-height: 200%\">&nbsp;</p>","isTop":"Y","secret":"Y","regDate":"20261019143748","viewCount":483,"isDone":"N","fileValue1":null,"fileValue2":null,"fileValue3":null,"fileValue4":null,"fileValue5":null,"title":"[성적, 학점인정] 2026학년도 2학기 중간 강의평가(Midterm Course Evaluation for Fall 2026)","userId":"regist","configPkId":2,"userNickName":"학사지원팀","isNickName":"N","bbsType":"N","previousId":551608,"previousTitle":"[전공] 2026학년도 2학기 전공 신청 및 변경 안내","afterId":551650,"afterTitle":"[국내교류] 2026학년도 동계 계절수업 부산대학교 교류 수학 안내","del":"N","itemGubunTitle":null,"itemGubunPkId":null,"description":null,"displayName":"학사지원팀","isPhotoTopView":null,"show_sDate":null,"show_eDate":null,"mainYn":"N","memoRes":null,"introList":null,"introTitleList":["성적, 학점인정"],"link":null,"sdate":null,"edate":null,"qaresponse":null}}